WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:02.980
There's 80 meters to the first result line.

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:03.730
I...

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:04.770
I...

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.480
I'll win!

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:08.020
Pig!

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:09.150
I got this!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.570
Orange!

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:12.030
He's coming!

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.530
Sprint!

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.330
They're both accelerating!

00:00:19.270 --> 00:00:20.870
I'll win!

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:22.750
<i>Go, Kaburagi.</i>

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:24.710
<i>You can do it!</i>

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:30.220
They're neck and neck again!

00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:31.880
It's the final sprint!

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.430
<i>The pig's a few centimeters ahead.</i>

00:00:36.430 --> 00:00:37.050
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:00:37.590 --> 00:00:39.430
<i>The line's right in front 
of me. I can see it.</i>

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:43.310
<i>Boil, damn it!</i>

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:58.570
<b>| 1 | Doubashi Masakiyo | 15 | Kanagawa | Hakone Academy High School |
| 2 | Kaburagi Issa | 6 | Chiba | Sohoku High School |</b>

00:00:57.540 --> 00:01:01.240
<i>The winner of the first result 
and green number tag is</i>

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.790
<i>Hakone Academy High School's 
Doubashi Masakiyo!</i>

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.150
<i>The first number tag of the Inter-High 
goes to Hakone Academy High School!</i>

00:01:09.150 --> 00:01:11.010
Hakone Academy High School!

00:01:11.010 --> 00:01:13.000
Of course it's Hakone Academy High School!

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.680
Doubashi's the champion!

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:17.570
That's the pose I wanted to see!

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:26.980
I'm Hakone Academy High School!

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:31.910
<i>Damn, damn, damn...</i>

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:33.930
<i>I lost.</i>

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:56.130
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:03:06.470 --> 00:03:10.980
<i>RIDE.21  Hakone Academy High School Makes Its Move!</i>

00:03:13.170 --> 00:03:15.170
<b>1. 15 Doubashi Masakiyo
2. 6 Kaburagi Issa</b>

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:17.460
<i>The first result...</i>

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.970
<i>Sohoku High School placed second.</i>

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.520
Hakone Academy High School's moving up!

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:31.930
Excuse us.

00:03:33.140 --> 00:03:35.790
Make way, Teshima-kun.

00:03:38.100 --> 00:03:41.780
Kanagawa's ultimate champions,
Hakone Academy High School, moved up!

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:43.750
They're so intimidating!

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:47.580
The team that takes the 
first result controls the pack!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.290
<i>They're in front of us!</i>

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.180
<i>Hakone Academy High School...</i>

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.210
<i>They're first.</i>

00:03:52.210 --> 00:03:54.670
<i>They're where we were last year.</i>

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.170
<i>The winners' position.</i>

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:59.190
Well done, Doubashi.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:01.600
Basshi...

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.930
It went just as planned, Touichirou.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:07.390
I can't believe he won one 
against two on the flats.

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:08.790
It's amazing.

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:12.650
Hayato-kun said Doubashi-san could do it.

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:15.940
Things feel more stable with
Hakone Academy High School in the front.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.580
That position's a perfect fit for them.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:18.570
Their aura is different.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.040
Yeah. I feel calmer with
Hakone Academy High School forming the pack.

00:04:22.040 --> 00:04:25.740
Let's absorb our sprinters as we 
ride to the foot of the mountain.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:27.740
We can take a break.

00:04:28.210 --> 00:04:30.740
Time to go to work.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:33.410
Andy, Frank...

00:04:34.090 --> 00:04:35.500
Our job starts now.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:38.430
Huh?

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:40.710
Hey, there's space behind you.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.580
They're doing it on purpose.

00:04:43.580 --> 00:04:44.400
What?

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:48.300
They're planning to increase their speed 
and decrease the pack's numbers...

00:04:49.090 --> 00:04:52.680
At the start of the Inter-High's first day!

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:54.100
Abs!

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:56.990
Seriously? But we're still 
so far from the mountains.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:59.130
We underestimated them. They're fast.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.230
Sohoku High School's jumping ahead, too!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.070
But I knew they'd do this.

00:05:03.070 --> 00:05:04.360
Let's go as hard as we can.

00:05:04.800 --> 00:05:07.180
Onoda, Naruko, Imaizumi!

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:07.820
Yes, sir!

00:05:07.820 --> 00:05:10.230
You came, Sohoku High School.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.290
Abs!

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.500
Sorry, but you're not getting away,
Hakone Academy High School.

00:05:14.880 --> 00:05:17.360
You seem pretty desperate, Izumida.

00:05:17.360 --> 00:05:20.250
You're already trying to reduce your 
competition at the start of the race.

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:25.110
We're wearing double-digit tags when 
we should be wearing single digits.

00:05:25.570 --> 00:05:28.510
Do you know what that means, Teshima-kun?

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:30.470
I do.

00:05:30.470 --> 00:05:34.430
After all, we were wearing 
triple digits last year.

00:05:35.050 --> 00:05:41.190
It means that by any means necessary, 
we must retake the title of champions.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:47.230
I didn't participate in the first result 
so I could create this situation.

00:05:47.230 --> 00:05:48.030
Abs!

00:05:48.030 --> 00:05:50.160
Hakone Academy High School 
is accelerating even more.

00:05:50.510 --> 00:05:51.140
After them!

00:05:51.350 --> 00:05:52.360
Yes, sir!

00:05:55.400 --> 00:05:58.210
The way you ride is so ordinary, Teshima-kun.

00:05:58.700 --> 00:05:59.850
Are you struggling?

00:06:00.290 --> 00:06:03.630
Isn't it because you sent two 
riders to compete in the sprint?

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:05.630
I'm weak.

00:06:06.810 --> 00:06:09.050
That's why I use my head.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.690
It's why I work hard.

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:12.570
I have a plan.

00:06:12.570 --> 00:06:13.260
Go!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.480
Naruko Shoukichi!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.060
You got it!

00:06:17.380 --> 00:06:21.440
We held onto our best man on the flats, too.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:24.780
I'm itching to go!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.780
Wanna pick up where we left off, lashes?

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.280
I couldn't ask for more, redhead!

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:33.950
Abs!

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.370
I won't stop you this time!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.490
Naruko!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.490
Touichirou!

00:06:39.490 --> 00:06:40.790
Go!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:44.550
Abs! Abs! Abs! Abs!

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:53.760
I gave everything I had and lost.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.090
<i>There's only one winner.</i>

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:01.900
<i>"Good job."</i>

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.520
<i>"You were amazing."</i>

00:07:04.340 --> 00:07:07.050
<i>All praise is meaningless 
in the face of defeat.</i>

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:10.490
<i>I don't know what to say to him.</i>

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:12.760
Issa!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:15.390
Issa!

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:17.950
Issa!

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.870
Danchiku...

00:07:21.910 --> 00:07:23.240
I'm Kaburagi Issa.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:25.360
This is Danchiku Ryuuhou.

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.500
This race is mine.

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.340
We're going to the Inter-High, Danchiku.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:33.300
I see two lights in you.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.100
Two lights I don't have.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.180
Issa!

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:39.430
Don't waver!

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:44.940
I won't be in the race, but you go 
all-out at the Inter-High, Issa.

00:07:45.420 --> 00:07:47.560
I will.

00:07:47.560 --> 00:07:49.190
You just watch me, Danchiku.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.330
<i>He's the last person
 I want to talk to right now.</i>

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:02.100
<i>I lost to a pig.</i>

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:07.960
I was watching!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:33.570
<i>Danchiku, I lost.</i>

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:41.160
<i>I rode as hard as I could and lost the race.</i>

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.970
Kaburagi!

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:45.790
I was watching!

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.500
Sugimoto-san...

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:57.470
Push Imaizumi's back.

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:02.220
I will.

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.560
Thank you.

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:05.730
Kaburagi!

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:07.310
Kaburagi-kun!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.440
First-year!

00:09:08.440 --> 00:09:10.400
We were watching!

00:09:10.730 --> 00:09:11.860
Yes, sir!

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.570
<i>Koga-san, guys...</i>

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:19.210
We'll be waiting for you 
at the feed zone up ahead!

00:09:23.790 --> 00:09:27.630
Why? What was that, Aoyagi-san?

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:31.840
I didn't win.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:34.980
They should be asking me, 
"What are you doing?"

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:37.600
"How could you lose when you were so close?"

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:41.850
They should be rebuking me and
 telling me I'm the worst, but instead...

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:45.660
They just said they were 
watching and nothing else.

00:09:46.430 --> 00:09:47.830
Their hands were so warm.

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.140
Why?

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:53.890
Koga-san, Sugimoto-san, and Danchiku...

00:09:55.710 --> 00:09:58.020
Because they're your teammates.

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:03.150
And because they all know the pain of losing.

00:10:07.650 --> 00:10:11.500
<i>I know a lot about injuries.</i>

00:10:12.230 --> 00:10:14.130
<i>I did everything I could!</i>

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.970
Good, Issa.

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:19.590
Damn!

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.800
Damn, damn, damn!

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:25.100
Aoyagi-san, I promise!

00:10:25.530 --> 00:10:29.100
If I end up racing against him 
again at this Inter-High...

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:31.980
I promise I'll beat him!

00:10:32.340 --> 00:10:33.240
Good.

00:10:33.970 --> 00:10:37.010
I'm riding with the team's hopes on my back.

00:10:37.010 --> 00:10:39.700
Why didn't I realize that?

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.530
I'm an idiot.

00:10:42.050 --> 00:10:45.240
<i>"Grow. Over these three days."</i>

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:49.390
<i>That's what Kinjou-san 
told Imaizumi last year.</i>

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:53.380
<i>I'll pass on the exact same message to you.</i>

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.920
<i>Experience pain, give everything you have...</i>

00:10:57.330 --> 00:11:00.370
<i>And grow straight, Kaburagi.</i>

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:08.020
Abs!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.100
Hakone Academy High School's 
accelerating even more.

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:12.100
We're counting on you, Naruko!

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:13.900
Got it!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.820
Abs, abs, abs, abs, abs, abs!

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:17.980
Abs!

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:24.040
Touichirou, you're raising the pace again?

00:11:24.040 --> 00:11:25.750
Don't you feel bad for them?

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.980
They disappeared behind the 
corner in the blink of—

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.330
They're keeping up.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:33.690
How persistent.

00:11:34.210 --> 00:11:37.320
Team Sohoku's persistent again this year.

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:39.790
Naruko-kun's reactions are first-class, too.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:44.050
Yuki, remember this tenacity.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:49.240
They used it to steal the 
title from us last year.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:51.510
You have a good team, Teshima-kun.

00:11:51.960 --> 00:11:54.150
You're worthy of being
crushed with all our might.

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:56.820
Are you supporting each other?

00:11:57.260 --> 00:12:01.400
That's what Sohoku High School's 
captain Kinjou-san said last year.

00:12:01.400 --> 00:12:05.130
On your team, when one man falls,
the others support him.

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:07.330
A team that supports each other.

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:08.900
That's right.

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:13.820
I've added the sauce of faith to 
that and made it in my own style.

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:15.800
Are you planning on cooking something?

00:12:15.800 --> 00:12:17.340
Yeah, something Mediterranean.

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:19.360
That sounds good.

00:12:19.360 --> 00:12:20.510
I'll eat it for you.

00:12:20.860 --> 00:12:22.160
It's super spicy.

00:12:22.160 --> 00:12:23.470
You'll upset your stomach.

00:12:27.820 --> 00:12:30.430
I see. You sound confident.

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:32.670
Then let me ask you this.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:39.320
Why did your spicy team send two sprinters 
against our Doubashi and lose?

00:12:41.190 --> 00:12:43.730
You wasted your time.

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:47.050
Because one man isn't enough.

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:48.560
I told you.

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:50.540
We're a team that supports each other.

00:12:50.910 --> 00:12:53.670
We're not complete until 
there's more than one.

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:55.670
That's why I sent two.

00:12:56.410 --> 00:13:00.550
I know Kaburagi and Aoyagi believed 
in each other as they fought.

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:04.380
Wasted our time? Don't worry about us.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.680
Defeat is the first step towards victory.

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:10.890
It gives rise to the next will and action.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.150
And we pass that will along.

00:13:13.150 --> 00:13:15.600
Carefully, between all of us.

00:13:16.210 --> 00:13:17.440
<i>Teshima-san...</i>

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:22.570
That's your team, this year's Team Sohoku.

00:13:22.990 --> 00:13:24.280
I understand.

00:13:24.890 --> 00:13:28.250
Since we have the chance, 
let me introduce my team.

00:13:28.930 --> 00:13:30.200
This year I created

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:34.700
the most passionate team
Hakone Academy High School has ever seen.

00:13:36.280 --> 00:13:41.550
Powerfully, coolly, passionately, 
we'll aim for victory.

00:13:41.870 --> 00:13:44.130
We're the strongest team.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:47.130
<i>The strongest...</i>

00:13:49.770 --> 00:13:51.010
<i>Passion...</i>

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:56.470
<i>There's a wall in front of us.</i>

00:13:57.800 --> 00:14:00.980
<i>Hakone Academy High School is a wall.</i>

00:14:01.850 --> 00:14:03.270
Onoda.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:06.760
If you have one thing you're good at,

00:14:06.760 --> 00:14:09.160
and you're prevented from 
doing it, what would you do?

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:13.370
<i>The wall in front of us...</i>

00:14:14.260 --> 00:14:16.270
Wait? Run?

00:14:16.270 --> 00:14:17.540
Go around it?

00:14:17.540 --> 00:14:19.290
Would you become depressed?

00:14:25.030 --> 00:14:26.840
You've gotta break through, yeah?

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:29.120
Yes, sir.

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:31.430
We have to break through, yeah.

00:14:32.020 --> 00:14:35.720
Through the giant wall of 
Hakone Academy High School.

00:14:36.270 --> 00:14:40.440
You're right. We have to break through, yeah.

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:41.810
Yeah.

00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:43.770
You're right, Onoda-kun.

00:14:43.770 --> 00:14:45.400
Yeah.

00:14:45.400 --> 00:14:46.380
Yeah.

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:49.490
Wait, what?

00:14:49.490 --> 00:14:54.210
Um, did I say that out loud?

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:55.410
Did I?

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:56.090
Yeah.

00:14:56.090 --> 00:14:57.000
You did.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:15:01.950
I-I meant to think
"break through" inside my head...

00:15:01.950 --> 00:15:03.510
Are you serious?

00:15:03.510 --> 00:15:05.400
You said it really loud.

00:15:07.620 --> 00:15:10.760
Sometimes you say "yeah" 
when we're in class, too.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:11.590
What?

00:15:13.930 --> 00:15:15.560
D-Don't fall asleep, yeah.

00:15:18.120 --> 00:15:19.680
I have to do my best, yeah.

00:15:27.250 --> 00:15:28.380
Touichirou...

00:15:29.580 --> 00:15:31.170
What are they?

00:15:31.170 --> 00:15:33.130
They're at a disadvantage.

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:36.240
They lost the first result, too.

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:38.830
But they're overflowing with pressure.

00:15:39.340 --> 00:15:40.750
I thought so.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.770
It's the one with the glasses.

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:45.000
Second-year Onoda.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:49.010
He's creating that atmosphere.

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:52.720
It doesn't look that way to me.

00:15:52.720 --> 00:15:56.440
You told me to be careful, 
but he doesn't feel strong.

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.850
Doubashi said it was just a fluke, too.

00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.120
It must've been a fluke.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:05.220
Otherwise, there's no way 
those guys would've lost.

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:07.210
Right, Kuroda-san?

00:16:07.210 --> 00:16:08.340
I get it.

00:16:08.340 --> 00:16:10.320
You already told me that.

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.830
No, I'm not finished.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:17.580
It must've been a fluke that Onoda 
won the general classification.

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.710
That skinny kid...

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:23.710
He brings out the unlikely in road races.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:26.030
The unexpected, Yuki.

00:16:26.650 --> 00:16:30.210
Sohoku High School's key man,
Onoda Sakamichi...

00:16:30.750 --> 00:16:35.540
We need to eliminate him from the 
race sooner rather than later.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.890
We've caught up to the lead sprinters.

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:41.900
Aoyagi-san!

00:16:41.900 --> 00:16:42.830
Kabu!

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:43.520
Doubashi!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:47.200
Good job, Doubashi.

00:16:47.200 --> 00:16:48.460
Izumida-san!

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:49.650
Basshi...

00:16:50.100 --> 00:16:53.400
I beat Sohoku High School 
to win the first result.

00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.270
Well done.

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:02.030
Why'd you lose, Kabu?

00:17:02.030 --> 00:17:04.680
How could you lose after running 
off like that, showoff?

00:17:04.680 --> 00:17:05.830
Why?

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:08.420
Everyone else was so nice.

00:17:08.950 --> 00:17:10.840
Because we don't like you.

00:17:11.270 --> 00:17:12.960
You're a disappointment.

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:15.150
Seriously?

00:17:15.150 --> 00:17:17.860
Really? Really? Really?

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:21.310
Sorry, Junta.

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.380
It's fine.

00:17:23.380 --> 00:17:24.790
The race is long.

00:17:24.790 --> 00:17:26.350
We can still make up for it.

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:29.590
Onoda...

00:17:30.200 --> 00:17:31.210
Yes, sir?

00:17:31.210 --> 00:17:33.120
I have orders for you.

00:17:33.120 --> 00:17:35.700
Orders? Yes, sir.

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.570
Junta?

00:17:38.050 --> 00:17:40.550
Stay close to us.

00:17:40.550 --> 00:17:41.230
What?

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:43.990
Stay toward the front.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:45.540
<i>Teshima-san?</i>

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:49.470
Is it because the mountains are close?

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:52.710
Because Hakone Academy High School
 will make a move?

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.760
But we still have a little ways 
to go before the mountains.

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:56.720
They're making their move!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:06.800
B-But their pace isn't that fast.

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:09.600
Not fast? It's the opposite, Kaburagi.

00:18:10.160 --> 00:18:11.360
The opposite?

00:18:11.360 --> 00:18:15.910
You haven't noticed because 
we've been matching their pace.

00:18:16.500 --> 00:18:21.320
Hakone Academy High School has been 
gradually and deliberately slowing their pace,

00:18:21.690 --> 00:18:26.970
so we wouldn't notice as they drew them in...

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.670
The pack behind us!

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:35.210
There's Sohoku High School!

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:36.440
And Hakone Academy High School!

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:38.090
All right! We caught them!

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:38.930
You're not getting away!

00:18:39.340 --> 00:18:41.080
<i>No way. Seriously?</i>

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.550
<i>I didn't notice them come up behind us.</i>

00:18:42.950 --> 00:18:44.490
<i>The pack...</i>

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:45.740
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:48.060
<i>They're out for blood since we passed them.</i>

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:56.250
<i>Such a large gathering of 
wills can breed insanity.</i>

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:01.280
We'll join the pack temporarily.

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.430
There are advantages.

00:19:02.430 --> 00:19:04.230
We'll be able to rest.

00:19:04.230 --> 00:19:06.200
In any case, stay with the team.

00:19:06.200 --> 00:19:07.980
Sohoku High School!

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:09.040
Chiba!

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:10.600
<i>But...</i>

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.260
Damn it.

00:19:12.260 --> 00:19:14.290
<i>It's not just advantages.</i>

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.050
Onoda!

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.130
Yes, sir!

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:18.670
To the front.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.300
We absorbed Sohoku High School 
and Hakone Academy High School!

00:19:23.300 --> 00:19:24.210
All right!

00:19:24.210 --> 00:19:25.970
You can't just do as you please!

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.970
See how strong we are?

00:19:30.450 --> 00:19:33.740
We're passing through old Imaichi City
and heading towards Nikkou City.

00:19:33.740 --> 00:19:35.090
We're almost at the mountains.

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:36.320
Keep it up.

00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:41.530
Onoda? Where's Onoda?

00:19:44.210 --> 00:19:45.030
Teshima-san...

00:19:45.440 --> 00:19:47.960
Stay close to us.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:49.040
What?

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:51.040
Stay toward the front.

00:19:51.570 --> 00:19:53.390
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:55.670
<i>I'm so far behind.</i>

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:03.670
Um, it's dangerous to stick too close.

00:20:03.670 --> 00:20:04.840
Could you—

00:20:07.080 --> 00:20:09.630
Y-You're too close, guys.

00:20:09.630 --> 00:20:11.660
It's dangerous while we're riding.

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:13.400
I can't move ahead when you're so—

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.020
Sorry, but we're doing it deliberately.

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.400
We're not letting you get to the front.

00:20:20.750 --> 00:20:21.900
What?

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:27.740
Onoda-san's been separated.

00:20:29.100 --> 00:20:32.250
He's too small. I can't see him.

00:20:33.230 --> 00:20:34.610
Do you think he's all right?

00:20:34.610 --> 00:20:36.060
Will he come up to us?

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:39.590
No, that may be difficult.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:40.540
What?

00:20:42.930 --> 00:20:44.540
We're almost at the mountains.

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:49.870
And he's wearing tag #1.

00:20:51.220 --> 00:20:53.560
Tag #1?

00:20:53.970 --> 00:20:57.440
He's last year's champion and a climber.

00:20:57.440 --> 00:21:02.190
The other teams will be looking out 
for a #1 who won a climb.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.070
They'll be keeping him in check.

00:21:04.540 --> 00:21:08.530
Onoda will experience for the first time

00:21:09.010 --> 00:21:11.080
the real pressure that comes with tag #1.

00:21:12.740 --> 00:21:14.020
<i>Hakone Academy High School...</i>

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:19.700
Looks like we won't have to use Yuto.

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:23.760
<i>Teshima-san...</i>

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:27.510
<i>I can't get to the front.</i>

00:23:11.060 --> 00:23:13.320
Are you hungry?

00:23:14.790 --> 00:23:17.620
Are you sure you should be 
acting that way toward me?

00:23:24.270 --> 00:23:26.740
Hey, what's with the change in attitude?

00:23:26.740 --> 00:23:28.970
Are you an idol who's only 
nice at handshake events?

00:23:28.970 --> 00:23:30.340
Were you faking it?

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:33.890
Yuki...

00:23:32.490 --> 00:23:33.890
Yuki-chan...

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:39.850
<i>NEXT RIDE  The Pressure of Tag #1</i>

00:23:39.850 --> 00:23:44.860
This is a work of fiction. All characters and organizations
 appearing in this work are fictional. In this work,
 characters sometimes engage in dangerous activities.
 While riding bicycles on actual roads,
 please follow all traffic laws and ride safely.

00:23:44.860 --> 00:23:51.000
<b><i>The high cadence
 continues!!</i></b>
